{
  "analysis": "The source header confirms 640x400 32-bit framebuffer. Symbols show DG_Init at 0x4395b0, DG_DrawFrame near there, DG_GetTicksMs, DG_SleepMs, etc. The output was truncated before showing Makefile, program headers, and syscall details. I need the platform-specific DG_DrawFrame implementation and exact syscall instruction sites.",
  "plan": "Look for the image/platform implementation file used for this build (likely doomgeneric_img.c or similar generated source), inspect the Makefile and program headers again, and disassemble around syscall sites and DG_DrawFrame to understand file saving behavior and syscall ABI.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "find /app/doomgeneric -maxdepth 3 -type f \\( -name '*img*' -o -name 'Makefile*' \\) -print\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "sed -n '1,320p' /app/doomgeneric/doomgeneric/Makefile\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "find /app/doomgeneric -maxdepth 3 -type f -name 'doomgeneric_img*' -print -exec sed -n '1,340p' {} \\;\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "readelf -l /app/doomgeneric_mips\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "objdump -d /app/doomgeneric_mips | grep -B2 -A2 -n \"syscall\" | head -120\n",
      "duration": 1.0
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "objdump -d --start-address=0x4395b0 --stop-address=0x439a00 /app/doomgeneric_mips\n",
      "duration": 1.0
    }
  ]
}
